:- dynamic dh3/3 as incremental.
dh3(f(2),1,f(2)). dh3(f(2),2,f(2)). dh3(f(2),3,f(2)). dh3(f(2),4,f(2)). dh3(f(2),5,f(2)). dh3(f(2),6,f(2)). dh3(f(2),7,f(2)). dh3(f(2),8,f(2)). 

