:- hilog minimum.
minimum(X,Y,Z) :- X @< Y -> Z=X ; Z=Y.
:- hilog maximum.
maximum(X,Y,Z) :- X @< Y -> Z=Y ; Z=X.
:- hilog sum.
sum(X,Y,Z) :- Z is X+Y.
:- hilog successor.
successor(X,_Y,Z) :- Z is X+1.
:- hilog sumcount.
sumcount([S|C],X,[S1|C1]) :- S1 is S+X, C1 is C+1.

